{
  "key_fact_results": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 9,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101065074827065607",
          "quote": "SET amount = amount * (SELECT scale FROM currency_scale WHERE code = 'CNY')"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 9,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101065074827065607",
          "quote": "WHERE created_year < 2026;"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 14,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629115",
          "quote": "\"columns\": [\"code\", \"scale\"], \"rows\": [[\"CNY\", 100], [\"USD\", 100]]"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "0013 脚本对 created_year < 2026 的 orders 执行 amount = amount * (currency_scale 中 CNY 的 scale)，而 currency_scale 查询显示 CNY 的 scale = 100，因此该脚本确实把这些行的 amount 乘以 100。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 12,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629116",
          "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 12,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629116",
          "quote": "`daily_settlement.sql` 由财务每日 07:00 执行，导出订单金额明细，金额单位为元。"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 15,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629114",
          "quote": "\"table\": \"orders\", \"row_count\": 1200000, \"columns\": [{\"column\": \"id\", \"null_count\": 0, \"distinct_count\": 1200000}, {\"column\": \"amount\", \"null_count\": 0, \"distinct_count\": 149}"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "reports/daily_settlement.sql 用 amount/100.0 作为 amount_yuan，README 说明报告输出金额单位为元，可推断 amount 以整数分存储；表统计显示 amount 为 INTEGER（1,200,000 行无空值），各年份金额区间一致（8900–23700），与分单位一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 9,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101065074827065607",
          "quote": "ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN wms_ref;"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 7,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101075039151187065",
          "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_order_ops AS SELECT id,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 7,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101075039151187065",
          "quote": "CREATE VIEW v_partner_daily AS SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount FROM orders"
        },
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 12,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629116",
          "quote": "SELECT created_year,wms_ref,amount/100.0 AS amount_yuan FROM orders;"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "0014 脚本含 ALTER TABLE orders DROP COLUMN wms_ref；reports/daily_settlement.sql 与视图 v_order_ops、v_partner_daily 的 SELECT 中均引用 orders.wms_ref，删除该列会波及这三处。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "supported": true,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "tool_result",
          "message_index": 12,
          "tool_call_id": "call_-7101070778543629116",
          "quote": "WMS 接口只同步当期数据，历史回传记录不在 WMS 侧长期保留。"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "ops/WMS对接说明.md 明确写明 WMS 只同步当期数据、历史回传记录不在 WMS 侧长期保留，即只同步当期且不留历史。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "四条要点均有材料直接或可明确推断支持：0013 会把 2026 年前 orders.amount 乘 100（CNY scale=100），而 amount 已按分存储、日报用 /100.0 换算元，两者存在冲突风险；0014 删除的 wms_ref 被日报与两个视图引用；WMS 说明确认不留历史。"
}
